+
+## Troubleshooting
+
+### `tasktrack: command not found`
+
+`pip` put the program in a folder that is not on your `PATH`. Run `python -m pip show -f tasktrack` to see where it was installed, and add the folder that holds the `tasktrack` program to your `PATH`.
+
+### `requires a different Python`
+
+Your Python is older than 3.11. Check it with `python --version`, and install a newer one.
